        "Graues Papier (CIE 60–80)"@de,
        "Gray Paper (CIE 60–80)"@en,
        "Papel Gris (CIE 60–80)"@es,
        "ग्रे काग़ज़ (CIE 60–80)"@hi,
        "グレー用紙（CIE 60〜80）"@ja,
        "Grått papir (CIE 60–80)"@nb,
        "Grijs papier (CIE 60–80)"@nl,
        "Papier szary (CIE 60–80)"@pl,
        "Papel cinza (CIE 60–80)"@pt,
        "Grått papper (CIE 60–80)"@sv,
        "灰色纸 (CIE 60–80)"@zh-Hans ;
